- **Is (II) the reason for (I)?** No. $P\propto V^3$ comes from the kinetic energy of the moving air ($\tfrac12 V^2$ per kg) times the mass flow ($\rho AV$ per second); it has nothing to do with the turbine type.

**Answer: (B).**
', status = 'READY', answer_type = 'MCQ', nat_min = NULL, nat_max = NULL, difficulty = 2, answer_status = 'UNVERIFIED', content_key = 'ese-2017-150', origin = 'PYQ', updated_at = now() WHERE id = qid;
